Package: parqpost
Title: Selective Access to Posterior Draws in Parquet
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("parqpost", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: Access posterior draws stored in Parquet through lazy Arrow
    queries. Select parameters and subset chains and iterations before reading
    values into memory, reshape indexed draws, compute convergence diagnostics,
    and produce exact equal-tailed credible intervals for plotting.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    arrow (>= 12.0.0),
    dplyr (>= 1.1.1),
    posterior (>= 1.4.0),
    rlang,
    tibble,
    tidyselect
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tidybayes
